 \n- Reproducible in 4.4.stable, Linux, x64, and 4.4.1.stable.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable - Manjaro Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Wed Dec 11 22:24:04 UTC 2024 on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) HD Graphics 5500 (BDW GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-5200U CPU @ 2.20GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt seems this was handled by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/58377, but does not address Types defined in nodes via `class_name MyType`. I think this breaks the expectation of filtering by type, since hovering on a node in the SceneTree, will reveal its most specific type, including the user defined.\n\nThe custom type nodes are matched when you specify a type that they inherit, but not the direct one.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a Scene with one node, with a script attached that defines its `class_name MyType`.\nGo to the search bar in the Scene Tree in the same scene (or any other scene where the node is instantiated) and type `t:MyType`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug_typesearch.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19614790/bug_typesearch.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105049/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}